dging-any-interventions-success)410 0 R(dead-end-concluding-directly-that-service-quality-decline-is-the-confirmed-root-cause)414 0 R(dead-end-presenting-a-naive-37-annualized-figure-as-a-confirmed-crisis-level-finding)413 0 R(dead-end-treating-ticket-volume-up-as-fully-explained-by-organic-customer-base-growth)412 0 R(executive-summary)400 0 R(northbrook-churn-spike-root-cause-and-diagnostic-plan)399 0 R]>>>>>>
